  "description": {
    "raw": "Your melee touch attack deals 1d6 points of nonlethal cold damage + 1 point per level, and the target is fatigued. The fatigued condition ends when the target recovers from the nonlethal damage. This spell cannot make a creature exhausted even if it is already fatigued. You can use this melee touch attack up to one time per level.",
    "search_text": "\"your melee touch attack deals 1d6 points of nonlethal cold damage + 1 point per level, and the target is fatigued. the fatigued condition ends when the target recovers from the nonlethal damage. this spell cannot make a creature exhausted even if it is already fatigued. you can use this melee touch attack up to one time per level.\"",
